<section class="page-hero wrap route-hero" id="booking-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">The details / Our checklist</p><h1>The details make<br><em>the difference.</em></h1><p class="lede">Rooms, surfaces and extras agreed in writing. A checklist you can review before your clean.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Before the visit.</h3><p>Record the rooms, surfaces, condition and requested extras. Confirm exclusions rather than leaving them to assumption.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Before confirmation.</h3><p>Match the scope to cleaner availability. Agree the written quote and practical arrangements with the customer.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>After the work.</h3><p>Review the agreed scope. Record any limitations or concerns and provide the follow-up agreed in the quote.</p></article></div></section><section class="soft"><div class="wrap section prose"><h2>A checklist that fits your home.</h2><p>Our approach starts with a room-by-room checklist. The work in your quote should be specific to your property, rather than relying on a number that means something different for every space.</p><p>What matters most is a scope the customer and cleaner both understand. You can ask about any task before accepting your quote.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap prose"><h2>One brief, fewer assumptions.</h2><p>The agreed work, preferences and necessary visit details should reach the assigned cleaner before the appointment. Customer access details need restricted handling, not a public document or general application email.</p><a href="/quality-reporting/">See an example completion note</a></section><section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>A clear plan for your next clean.</h2><p>Tell us about your space. We’ll review the scope, timing and cleaner availability before confirming your appointment.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/book/">Book your clean</a></section>
